function renderInventory(){renderCollection();const old=$('inventoryKind').value;$('inventoryKind').replaceChildren(...[...parts,'jewel','cuff'].map(k=>option(k,t(k))));$('inventoryKind').value=old||'jewel';const root=$('inventoryList');root.replaceChildren();const q=normalize($('inventoryQuery').value);const records=Object.values(owned).filter(o=>o?.item&&[o.item.ja,o.item.en].some(n=>normalize(n).includes(q)));if(!records.length)root.append(el('p',t('noInventory'),'muted'));for(const o of records.sort((a,b)=>name(a.item).localeCompare(name(b.item),lang))){const r=el('div',null,'inventory-row');r.append(el('strong',name(o.item)),el('small',t(o.kind)));const n=el('input');n.type='number';n.min='0';n.max='9999';n.value=o.count;n.setAttribute('aria-label',t('quantity')+' '+name(o.item));n.onchange=()=>{const v=Number(n.value);if(!Number.isInteger(v)||v<0||v>9999){n.value=o.count;return}o.count=v;persist('mhf.inventory',owned)};r.append(n,button(t('remove'),()=>{delete owned[o.item.id];persist('mhf.inventory',owned);renderInventory()}));root.append(r)}}
